GPU smoke case for the PPCG host/device bridge.

It uses the same GaAs structure as the CPU PPCG case, but samples a 2x2x2
Gamma-centered k-point mesh instead of the CPU case's 1x1x2 mesh. It checks the
standard energy, force and stress reference with the existing GPU acceptance
limits. Run it on a CUDA-enabled build with one OpenMP/BLAS thread; no CPU
timing or GPU speedup is inferred from this fixture.
